# 1Password setup
Include ~/.ssh/1Password/*

### global settings

ForwardX11 no
ForwardX11Trusted no
TCPKeepAlive yes

### github

Host github.com
User git
Hostname ssh.github.com
Port 443

### dispatch — fast reuse across many ssh calls (auto-multiplexing)

Host germputer
# ControlMaster auto
